<section id="A6.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.2 </span>Concept Performance Comparison for Visual Modality</h3>

<figure id="A6.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span><span id="A6.T6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Concept performance (Visual):</span> Per-concept accuracy (%) on Concept-ARC for medium effort + tools. Best value per concept in bold.</figcaption>
<table id="A6.T6.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A6.T6.4.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T6.4.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;"><span id="A6.T6.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Concept</span></td>
<td id="A6.T6.4.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="A6.T6.4.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
